 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "怎么防？分四层。",
   "spoken": "怎么防？分四层。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.832,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 3.6
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "用户这一层，把滑点设得合理。大额交易，走私有交易通道，比如 Flashbots Protect 一类的服务。",
   "spoken": "用户这一层，把滑点设得合理。大额交易，走私有交易通道，比如 Flashbots Protect 一类的服务。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.652,
   "dur": 8.112,
   "speechStart": 4.75,
   "speechEnd": 11.926
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "交易不进公开内存池，搜索者在打包之前，就看不到它。",
   "spoken": "交易不进公开内存池，搜索者在打包之前，就看不到它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-02.mp3",
   "start": 12.984,
   "dur": 5.376,
   "speechStart": 13.082,
   "speechEnd": 17.51
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "前端这一层，默认滑点要保守，按池子的深度来计算。",
   "spoken": "前端这一层，默认滑点要保守，按池子的深度来计算。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-03.mp3",
   "start": 18.58,
   "dur": 5.304,
   "speechStart": 18.678,
   "speechEnd": 23.035
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "合约这一层，所有交换函数，都要接受最小输出和截止时间两个参数。",
   "spoken": "合约这一层，所有交换函数，都要接受最小输出和截止时间两个参数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-04.mp3",
   "start": 24.104,
   "dur": 6.576,
   "speechStart": 24.202,
   "speechEnd": 29.845
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "常见的错误，是在合约内部，用现货价算出最小输出。",
   "spoken": "常见的错误，是在合约内部，用现货价算出最小输出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-05.mp3",
   "start": 30.9,
   "dur": 5.616,
   "speechStart": 30.998,
   "speechEnd": 35.688
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "那个现货价，在同一个区块里就能被推高。按它算出的保护，等于没有保护。",
   "spoken": "那个现货价，在同一个区块里就能被推高。按它算出的保护，等于没有保护。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-06.mp3",
   "start": 36.736,
   "dur": 6.912,
   "speechStart": 36.834,
   "speechEnd": 42.795
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "更糟的写法，是把最小输出直接写成 0。",
   "spoken": "更糟的写法，是把最小输出直接写成 0。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-07.mp3",
   "start": 43.868,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 43.966,
   "speechEnd": 47.62
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "这等于告诉所有人：我接受任何价格。金库、自动复投合约、清算合约，常犯这个错误。",
   "spoken": "这等于告诉所有人：我接受任何价格。金库、自动复投合约、清算合约，常犯这个错误。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-08.mp3",
   "start": 48.648,
   "dur": 8.616,
   "speechStart": 48.746,
   "speechEnd": 56.446
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "协议设计这一层，有两种做法。",
   "spoken": "协议设计这一层，有两种做法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-09.mp3",
   "start": 57.484,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 57.582,
   "speechEnd": 59.998
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "一是提交揭示：先提交答案的哈希，下一阶段再公开答案。",
   "spoken": "一是提交揭示：先提交答案的哈希，下一阶段再公开答案。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-10.mp3",
   "start": 61.064,
   "dur": 5.568,
   "speechStart": 61.162,
   "speechEnd": 65.781
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "这个承诺，必须绑定发送者的地址。不然，机器人复制你的承诺，也能完成揭示。",
   "spoken": "这个承诺，必须绑定发送者的地址。不然，机器人复制你的承诺，也能完成揭示。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-11.mp3",
   "start": 66.852,
   "dur": 7.8,
   "speechStart": 66.95,
   "speechEnd": 73.816
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "二是批量拍卖：同一批订单，按统一价格清算。",
   "spoken": "二是批亮拍卖：同一批订单，按统一价格清算。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-12.mp3",
   "start": 74.872,
   "dur": 4.728,
   "speechStart": 74.97,
   "speechEnd": 78.755
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "顺序由谁决定，每条链也不一样。",
   "spoken": "顺序由谁决定，每条链也不一样。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-13.mp3",
   "start": 79.82,
   "dur": 3.624,
   "speechStart": 79.918,
   "speechEnd": 82.596
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "BNB Chain，验证者轮流出块。2026 年 1 月，出块间隔缩短到 0.45 秒。",
   "spoken": "BNB Chain，验证者轮流出块。2026 年 1 月，出块间隔缩短到 0.45 秒。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-14.mp3",
   "start": 83.664,
   "dur": 7.512,
   "speechStart": 83.762,
   "speechEnd": 90.354
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "抢跑的窗口更短，但它有公开内存池和构建者市场，三明治依然存在。",
   "spoken": "抢跑的窗口更短，但它有公开内存池和构建者市场，三明治依然存在。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-15.mp3",
   "start": 91.396,
   "dur": 6.72,
   "speechStart": 91.494,
   "speechEnd": 97.267
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "TRON，27 个超级代表轮流出块。",
   "spoken": "TRON，27 个超级代表轮流出块。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-16.mp3",
   "start": 98.336,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 98.434,
   "speechEnd": 101.35
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "按 TRON 官方文档，它没有优先费，不能靠出更高的价格插队。",
   "spoken": "按 TRON 官方文档，它没有优先费，不能靠出更高的价格插队。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-17.mp3",
   "start": 102.396,
   "dur": 5.112,
   "speechStart": 102.494,
   "speechEnd": 106.672
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "但出块的人，仍然可以决定顺序。",
   "spoken": "但出块的人，仍然可以决定顺序。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-18.mp3",
   "start": 107.728,
   "dur": 3.528,
   "speechStart": 107.826,
   "speechEnd": 110.409
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "Mantle，只有一个中心化排序器。",
   "spoken": "Mantle，只有一个中心化排序器。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-19.mp3",
   "start": 111.476,
   "dur": 3.216,
   "speechStart": 111.574,
   "speechEnd": 113.859
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-20",
   "text": "L2BEAT 列出的风险是：运营者可以抢跑用户交易，提取 MEV。",
   "spoken": "L2BEAT 列出的风险是：运营者可以抢跑用户交易，提取 MEV。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-20.mp3",
   "start": 114.912,
   "dur": 6.36,
   "speechStart": 115.01,
   "speechEnd": 120.438
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-21",
   "text": "没有公开内存池，不等于没有 MEV。",
   "spoken": "没有公开内存池，不等于没有 MEV。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-21.mp3",
   "start": 121.492,
   "dur": 3.864,
   "speechStart": 121.59,
   "speechEnd": 124.506
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-22",
   "text": "它只是把排序权，从市场集中到一个运营者手里。",
   "spoken": "它只是把排序权，从市场集中到一个运营者手里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg3-22.mp3",
   "start": 125.576,
   "dur": 4.536,
   "speechStart": 125.674,
   "speechEnd": 129.281
  }
